### Guardar devoluciones de una orden de un plan de trabajo — resultado esperado (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/saveOrderReturns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workplanExecutionId": 1,
  "orderId": 1,
  "returnCount": 2,
  "responses": "",
  "tableResponses": "",
  "responseDate": "2026-01-15T10:00:00"
}

